  "notes": "RP2350 Stamp XL castellated module, 60 edge pads. GPIO pins are printed only as numbers (label kept as printed number). Functions read outward: SPI, UART, I2C, PWM slice (e.g. 0A), then analog/XIP CS/HSTX tags. Board corner marks 0/10/30/40 coincide with GPIO numbers and were not used as position numbers. Internal SWD and UART footprints (TX: IO0 RX: IO1) and buttons skipped. Color legend omitted."
